                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "68e890c1-69e2-3c4d-8d63-eb0c3fd68973",
                        "entry_id": "84e3334a-4bdb-3a6a-b524-c1fcdaa5c906",
                        "glosses": [
                            "傳染性的"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "d27f36e3-aca4-4db3-b720-dc54dd3de734",
                                "sense_id": "68e890c1-69e2-3c4d-8d63-eb0c3fd68973",
                                "text": "Because I think from a public health perspective, knowing that you are transmissible and going around transmitting, because sometimes that's not your main intention. I don't want to go around to transmit. But I think knowing that you are transmissible and still engaging in possible acts that might transmit the virus is an irresponsible thing to do.",
                                "translation": "因为从公共卫生的角度来看，我认为明知自己具有传染性却仍然四处传播病毒，虽然有时这并非你的主要目的。我并不想四处传播病毒。但我认为，明知自己具有传染性却仍然从事可能传播病毒的行为，是一种不负责任的行为。"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "cb26d86f-b2db-4fc5-96b3-74ee652b4f42",
                                "sense_id": "68e890c1-69e2-3c4d-8d63-eb0c3fd68973",
                                "text": "Bindloss said Hall had been \"fully and repeatedly\" warned about the infection risk he posed, yet chose to keep himself \"transmissible\" while lying about his status to sexual partners in a \"significant degree of premeditation\".",
                                "translation": "Bindloss 表示，Hall 曾被“充分且反复地”警告过他所带来的感染风险，但他仍然选择让自己“具有传染性”，并且“蓄意”向性伴侣谎报自己的感染状况。"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
